# Not content. These two are the Worker itself, generated by the Cloudflare adapter.
#
# Without this file Wrangler tries to upload dist/_worker.js as if it were a static
# asset and refuses to deploy, because doing so would publish the server code to the
# open internet. `main` in wrangler.toml already points at it, so it must not also
# be served from the assets bucket.
_worker.js
_routes.json
